# "Enchant creature" is any creature, and "you" in "each creature and/or enchantment you control" is the Aura's controller (CR 109.5),
# wherever the Aura sits: cast on Bot2's Ornithopter, it counts Bot1's Llanowar Elves and the Aura itself (2), not Bot2's Ornithopter,
# so the Ornithopter is a 2/4 and Bot1's Elves are still a 1/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Strength of the Harvest
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Strength of the Harvest.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Strength of the Harvest.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
